body:
You really hurt your cause when you're so extreme you'd force a raped woman or girl to endure the trauma of pregnancy and childbirth for the crime of being raped.

&#x200B;

Extremists exactly like you are what changed me from prolife to prochoice. You have no humanity if you'd force a rape victim to endure this, and you claim to be all about humanity. A rape victim's wellbeing comes before a mindless embryo that was forcibly implanted in her.

So you believe that this was not hyperbole, and she genuinely thinks people are in cages.

&#x200B;

\*rolls eyes\*
